      "content": "I get that, but I already looked at his interview transcripts. He seems way more into collaborative structures and steady workflows than the \"move fast and break things\" vibe we need. I'm worried he'll buckle under the heat or slow us down. Do you think there's anything in his profile I'm missing that would suggest he can actually handle our pace?",
