      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Building consensus\" and \"structured feedback\" can actually be strategic assets in high-pressure environments, offering a way to ensure buy-in and prevent costly, sudden missteps. In a demanding culture, methodical rigor can be the secret to *sustainable* aggressive growth, preventing burnout and reactive \"brute force\" tactics. You could interpret this focus as a need to build a resilient and highly effective machine, rather than just achieving a win at any cost.",
